# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MallMind Frontend — PUBLIC build-time configuration (COMMITTED ON PURPOSE)
#
# The hosted build (Lovable) compiles straight from the repository, so values
# that must reach the production bundle live here. Only PUBLIC config belongs in
# this file. NEVER put a key, token or project secret here — those go in
# .env.local (gitignored). Vite gives .env.local precedence over this file.
#
# Backend config (VITE_SUPABASE_URL / VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY /
# VITE_GOOGLE_BACKEND_URL) is deliberately NOT committed
# (docs/environments/mallmind-environment-separation.md); a build without it
# boots in backend-free mode (src/lib/supabaseClient.ts).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Public frontend origin: scheme + host only, no path, no trailing slash.
# Source of truth for QR deep links (scripts/navigation/generate-demo-qr.mjs).
VITE_PUBLIC_APP_ORIGIN=
